      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2015 the syndicate had opening gross claims outstanding of $446.119m (31 Dec 2014). Analysis of the gross claims development triangle shows adverse prior-year development of $31.612m (7.1% of opening reserves), i.e. a strengthening of reserves. The movement reflects adverse development and large individual losses and an increase in IBNR across several older underwriting years, driven particularly by large loss development in energy and aviation-related accounts and reserve deterioration in long-tail specialty classes (professional indemnity/design & construction).",
